flowchart TD
    Start([DiagnoseFailedDomainSubscriptionJob::handle]) --> Determine[FailedDomainSubscriptionRepairService::determineRepair]

    Determine --> HasDomain{subscription.domain<br/>set?}
    HasDomain -- No --> Skip[SKIP]
    HasDomain -- Yes --> HasDeploy{domainDeployment<br/>exists?}
    HasDeploy -- No --> Skip
    HasDeploy -- Yes --> HasDns{DnsDeployment<br/>found?}
    HasDns -- No --> Skip
    HasDns -- Yes --> Fetch[RtrService::fetchDomain]

    Fetch -- throws DomainDoesNotExist<br/>or 'Not found.' --> ListProc[RtrService::listProcessesForDomain]
    ListProc --> HasProc{processes > 0?}
    HasProc -- Yes --> RestorePath[RESTORE_FROM_PROCESS]
    HasProc -- No --> RetryPath[RETRY_PROVISIONING]

    Fetch -- throws other --> Skip

    Fetch -- success --> StatusOk{remote status<br/>contains OK?}

    StatusOk -- No --> NsDiff{remote ns differs<br/>from stored ns?}
    StatusOk -- Yes --> SyncOk[SYNC_STATUS_ONLY]/
    NsDiff -- Yes --> RepairNs[REPAIR_NAMESERVERS]
    NsDiff -- No --> SyncOk[SYNC_STATUS_ONLY]

    %% Direct mapping to repair jobs
    Skip --> Noop([No job dispatched])
    RepairNs --> JobNs[RepairMissingRemoteNameserversJob]
    RestorePath --> JobRestore[RestorePendingFromOpenPrevalidationProcessJob]
    RetryPath --> JobRetry[RetryDomainProvisioningJob]
    SyncOk --> JobSync[SyncDomainSubscriptionStatusFromRemoteJob]


    %% Job behaviors
    JobNs --> NsRun[Service::repairMissingRemoteNameservers]
    NsRun --> NsFetch[fetchDomain]
    NsFetch -- missing/error --> NsSkip([log skip])
    NsFetch -- has remote ns --> SyncFromRemote[syncLocalStatusFromRemoteDomain]
    NsFetch -- no remote ns --> NsStored{stored ns empty<br/>& INTERNAL?}
    NsStored -- Yes --> Assign[DnsNameserverAssigner::assign] --> NsStored2{stored ns still empty?}
    NsStored -- No --> NsStored2
    NsStored2 -- Yes --> NsSkip
    NsStored2 -- No --> Update[RtrService::updateNameServers + refetch] --> SyncFromRemote

    JobRestore --> ResRun[Service::restorePendingFromOpenPrevalidationProcess]
    ResRun --> ResFind[findOpenPrevalidationProcessForDomain]
    ResFind -- none --> ResSkip([log skip])
    ResFind -- found --> ResSet[subscription.technical_status = PENDING<br/>+ save + record result]

    JobRetry --> RetEnsure{domainDeployment<br/>exists?}
    RetEnsure -- No --> RetBuild[EventSubscriptionDataBuilder::buildDomainDeployment]
    RetEnsure -- Yes --> RetDispatch
    RetBuild --> RetDispatch[dispatch RegisterDomainNameJob]

    JobSync --> SyncSvc[Service::syncStatusFromRemote] --> SyncFromRemote

    SyncFromRemote --> Persist[update technical_status<br/>+ persist deployment result]
